# The Embarcadero promenade (city phase 11): long low granite edges along Herb Caen Way on the bay side,
# in runs of 24 m with gaps, every top edge a grind line. Rolling north-west beside one at 6 m/s, an
# ollie and grind pressed in the air: a 50-50 down the whole run (the balance bot keeps it), off the end, landed
# (since physics phase 31 the run pays PROMENADE EDGE). The squeezed city keeps two runs, re-homed to the
# seawall in front of Pier 7: this is the 24 m one south-east of it.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 604.18 873.98 -9.54 324.2
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x -3.516
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 4.866
hold ollie 4..14
tap grind 22
bot balance
run 800
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=ledge_604_875} within 23..27
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 655..680
expect event gap{id=promenade_edge} within 655..680
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 50-50 + PROMENADE EDGE} within 720..745
expect no event bail
